---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Bonfire — Features
description: Bonfire's building blocks, at a glance. Bonfire is a kit of composable blocks, not a one-size-fits all app or platform. Switch on what your community needs, leave out the rest.
---
{# ============================================================
   V3 · FEATURES — the block catalogue.
   Data-driven: edit the `sections` array below, the markup loops over it.
   Cards reuse the gather.njk --acc pattern (icon chip, kicker and hover
   border all read --acc). Icons are Phosphor duotone (loaded in base.njk).
   `status` is optional — set it only for blocks that aren't shipped yet,
   mirroring _data/extensions.json. No status = available today.
   ============================================================ #}

{% set sections = [
  {
    id: "post", img: "faeturecomposer.png", acc: "var(--color-flame)", eyebrow: "Post & converse", link: false,
    head: "Room to", headhl: "say it properly.",
    intro: "A composer that fits each kind of post, and threads that let a conversation branch out and stay legible as it grows.",
    shot: "The composer: formatting, mentions, and boundary controls in one place",
