    head: "Blocks for what your", headhl: "community does.",
    intro: "Talking is only the start. These blocks create a collaborative place where things get organised, decided, made, and kept. Several are still being built. We'd rather say so than pretend.",
    cards: [
      { icon: "ph-users-three", name: "Groups", text: "Groups with their own membership, visibility settings and governance. Local-only for now, while federation is designed in the open with the SWICG task force." },
      { icon: "ph-calendar-check", name: "Events", text: "Organise a gathering, and let people know they're coming." },
      { icon: "ph-chart-bar", name: "Decisions & consensus", text: "More than a quick poll: run proposals, structured consensus, and weighted score voting, so a group picks the lightest process that fits the decision." },
      { icon: "ph-scroll", name: "Community rules", text: "Shared expectations for an instance or a group, so newcomers know the space they're entering and moderators have something concrete to point to." },
